   "A": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the highway law, in relation to designating portions of the\nstate highway system as \"The Disabled American Veterans - New York Medal of\nHonor Highway\", the \"New York Medal of Honor Highway\" and the \"Sergeant\nJonathan Gollnitz - New York Medal of Honor Highway\"",
    "basePrintNo": "S7620",
